  "name": "Tropicon",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Tropicon was an annual furry convention in Berlin, Germany, organized by Konu Eikuku Hentaru and LeTigre and aimed mainly at the German furry community. It was held four times, from 2006 to 2009, on an island in an allotment settlement on Entenwall Island in Köpenick, with camping on a grassed area, a communal tent, a fursuit lounge and a small dock. From 2008 it ran the \"Tropical Fursuit Games\". The 2010 edition was cancelled when the site was converted to a nature reserve, and the new convention EAST became its replacement.",
